# Keep this directory in git so the Docker bind mount
# (docker/docker-compose.yml -> mcp service) has a pre-existing target.
#
# Self-healing (grocery_browser/self_healing.py) writes Claude-repaired flow
# functions here as <func_name>.py when a nodriver flow breaks at runtime —
# including inside the Docker container. The generated .py files are gitignored
# (review them, then port fixes into grocery_browser/flows.py); only this
# .gitkeep is tracked.
